      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="02 &middot; Rocket Giotto">02 &middot; Rocket Giotto</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Krom, wap, dan tiada tempat untuk bersembunyi.">Chrome, steam and nowhere to hide.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Mesin espresso yang digilap ialah cermin. Ia memantulkan lampu, kru, dan seluruh bilik &mdash; jadi pencahayaan mesti dibina di sekeliling pantulan dan bukannya melawannya.">A polished espresso machine is a mirror. It reflects the lights, the crew and the whole room &mdash; so the lighting has to be built around the reflections rather than fighting them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase reveal">
      <div class="showcase__media">
        <img src="assets/img/rocket-2.jpg" alt="Detail of the Rocket Giotto espresso machine during the launch shoot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="787">
