        <h3 data-bm="Digambarkan untuk runcit dan untuk suapan.">Shot for retail and for the feed.</h3>
        <p data-bm="Peruncit memerlukan syot bersih yang boleh dipotong; sosial memerlukan pergerakan, wap dan tangan. Kami merakam kedua-duanya dalam satu persediaan supaya jenama tidak perlu memilih antara kegunaan.">Retailers need clean, cut-out-ready stills; social needs movement, steam and hands. We capture both in one set-up so the brand does not have to choose between uses.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top:1.4rem" href="services.html" data-bm="Perkhidmatan produk kami <span class='arrow'>&rarr;</span>">Our product services <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
